<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS BEAT NATAL SHARKS 42-12.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS BEAT NATAL SHARKS 42-12.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British Lions beat the Natal</p>
<p>Sharks 42-12 (halftime 16-9) in their rugby union tour match at</p>
<p>Kings Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Natal - Penalties: Gavin Lawless (4).</p>
<p>British Lions - Tries: Gregor Townsend, Mike Catt, Lawrence</p>
<p>Dallaglio. Conversions: Neil Jenkins (3). Penalties: Jenkins</p>
<p>(6). Drop-goal: Townsend.</p>
</text>
